<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 2-mth balance of payments at $463.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Philippine 2-mth balance of payments at $463.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' balance of payments recorded a lower surplus of $463.8 million in the first two months of the year compared with $769.2 million in the same period last year, the Central Bank reported on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
